Name     U54B ;
PartNo   00 ;
Date     11/13/26 ;
Revision 01 ;
Designer Todd Houg ;
Company  CADzilla ;
Assembly CADzilla S-100 ACRTC board, rev B ;
Location U54 ;
Device   G16V8AS ;

/* SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-P-2.0 */
